@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans JP
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequence {
    ActorFontSize 18
    ActorFontStyle bold
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    NoteFontSize 14
    MessageFontSize 14
    BoxPadding 6
    ParticipantPadding 12
}
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam titleFontSize 20

title AIチャット

autonumber

actor "ユーザー" as User
participant "アプリ" as App
participant "Gemini API" as Gemini

== チャット開始 ==
User -> App: AIチャットを開く
App -> App: 画面表示

== 送信 ==
User -> App: メッセージ送信
App -> App: 吹き出し表示
App -> Gemini: POST /api/gemini
Gemini --> App: AI応答
App -> App: AI吹き出し表示

@enduml
